{"created": "2026-08-25T20:38:02.733773+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-25T20:38:03.086509+00:00", "id": 22101986, "conceptrecid": "20475136", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22101986", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20475136", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22101986", "metadata": {"title": "AI Runtime Evidence Protocol (AIREP)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22101986", "publication_date": "2026-08-25", "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong>AIREP v0.2.0-alpha.1</strong> is an experimental prerelease of the AI Runtime Evidence Protocol, a vendor- and model-independent evidence interchange format for AI runtime governance decisions. It does not supersede AIREP v0.1, which remains the stable and recommended implementation target.</p>\n<p>This prerelease contains the v0.2 integrity construction, five artifact schemas, the 117-fixture two-engine schema-validation corpus, the class-verifier contract, a 60-case class-verification corpus with 15 CLI/process probes, separately authored Python and Node verifier implementations, a third-component parity comparator with negative controls, committed measurement evidence, and vendored dependency bundles for offline/no-index reproduction.</p>\n<p>The measured class-verification result establishes agreement between the two implementations across the tested surface and separate agreement with frozen expected values. It does <strong>not</strong> establish correctness of the underlying semantics, third-party implementation or audit, truth or completeness of real-world evidence, or satisfaction of the AD-15 stable-release criteria. The initial official parity run that detected two CLI/run-validity divergences is preserved alongside the later passing runs; the checks that detected those divergences were not relaxed.</p>\n<p>The AIREP wire version remains <strong><code>0.2</code></strong>; <code>v0.2.0-alpha.1</code> is the release identifier for this prerelease.</p>\n<p>Protocol paper: <strong>&ldquo;AIREP: A Protocol for Per-Decision Evidence in AI Runtime Governance,&rdquo; arXiv:2608.21363.</strong></p>\n<p>AIREP v0.1 remains the stable/recommended target. Concept DOI for all AIREP versions: <strong>10.5281/zenodo.20475136</strong>.</p>\n<p><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Abak, Ali Toygar", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0002-3718-4010"}], "keywords": ["ai-governance", "runtime evidence", "interchange-format", "ai-accountability", "JSON schema", "hash chain", "audit", "RFC 8785"], "version": "v0.2.0-alpha.1", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}, {"id": "javascript", "title": {"en": "JavaScript"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20475136"}}]}}, "title": "AI Runtime Evidence Protocol (AIREP)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22101986", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22101986?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22101986", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22101986", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22101986", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20475136", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20475136", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20475136", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20475136", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22101986/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22101986/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22101986/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/requests"}, "updated": "2026-08-25T20:38:03.086509+00:00", "recid": "22101986", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "5ad5c2db-327d-45b7-aecb-746d7c7299b0", "key": "ai-runtime-evidence-protocol-v0.2.0-alpha.1.tar.gz", "size": 6566661, "checksum": "md5:7fadb6e595dabf68229a8de95d51b23d", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/files/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol-v0.2.0-alpha.1.tar.gz/content"}}, {"id": "86e2ab45-9f83-4c8c-9535-65f84ce266ea", "key": "SHA256SUMS.txt", "size": 231, "checksum": "md5:2093a001723d2fc7bff7d7c53681a1d8", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22101986/files/SHA256SUMS.txt/content"}}, {"id": "38b9d627-7d65-4af0-b4c2-a5d2b996c6f1", "key": "ai-runtime-evidence-protocol-v0.2.0-alpha.1.zip", "size": 7416783, "checksum": "md5:017d9b8df6e3e31657c4c8eadd8443ff", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/recor